/T (The proposed contribution is the integration of five modules into one understandable classroom-video analysis workflow. It emphasizes teacher-reviewable outputs rather than opaque automatic decisions. The project also identifies privacy, false-alert handling, and operating-condition limitations as factors that must be considered )
